      "units": "uptake in source micromol/m²/sec. The seven historical conc values define the observed grid only; the source describes conc as mL/L, retained as historical metadata without physical concentration conversion or extrapolation.",
      "uncertainty_policy": "Target the fixed-weight sum of four Type-by-Treatment stratum population means of a plant-specific concentration-grid average. Each observed plant contributes its arithmetic mean over all seven recorded concentrations. Weights are fixed at1/4 per stratum, with3independent plants observed in each stratum. Under a working model, plants are independent across units and exchangeable only within their stratum; those assumptions are not established by this historical archive. Bootstrap entire plants independently within each stratum, retaining3plants per stratum per replicate. Combine the four resampled stratum means with the fixed weights. This estimates sampling variation of that stipulated mixture target, not uncertainty in the already observed finite-panel average and not uncertainty from random treatment/region composition.",
