        "seed": 42,
        "random_protocol": "PCG64(seed). Sort strata and global plant IDs by(type name,string value). Process consecutive chunks of128replicates; within each chunk visit strata in canonical order and draw an integer-index array of shape(chunk_size,observed_plant_count_in_stratum), sampling uniformly with replacement. Average selected plant means within stratum, then sum using fixed stratum weights. Lower/upper percentiles use linear interpolation. This protocol is independently reproducible and does not claim R RNG equivalence.",
